#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:candy_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Accounting</strong>: Keep track of finances, payments, and invoices "
"effortlessly. Generate tax reports at the click of a button."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ການບັນຊີ</strong>: ຕິດຕາມການເງິນ, ການຊຳລະ, ແລະ ໃບເກັບເງິນໄດ້ຢ່າງສະດວກສະບາຍ. ສ້"
"າງລາຍງານອາກອນໄດ້ພຽງແຕ່ກົດປຸ່ມດຽວ."

#. module: candy_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:candy_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Automating with a Scale</strong>:"
msgstr "<strong>ການເຮັດວຽກອັດຕະໂນມັດຮ່ວມກັບຕາຊິງ</strong>:"

