msgstr "<strong>ການສ້າງເວັບໄຊທີ່ໜ້າດຶງດູດ</strong>:"

#. module: candy_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:candy_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Email Marketing</strong>: Send newsletters to keep customers updated "
"on promotions, seasonal products, and new arrivals."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ການຕະຫຼາດຜ່ານອີເມວ</strong>: ສົ່ງຈົດໝາຍຂ່າວເພື່ອແຈ້ງໃຫ້ລູກຄ້າຊາບກ່ຽວກັບໂປຣໂມຊັນ, ສິນຄ້າ"
"ຕາມລະດູການ, ແລະ ສິນຄ້າມາໃໝ່."

#. module: candy_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:candy_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid "<strong>Handling Online Orders</strong>:"
msgstr "<strong>ການຈັດການຄຳສັ່ງຊື້ອອນລາຍ</strong>:"

#. module: candy_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:candy_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Inventory</strong>: Track stock levels, manage reorders, and prevent "
"shortages."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ສາງສິນຄ້າ</strong>: ຕິດຕາມຈຳນວນສິນຄ້າໃນສາງ, ຈັດການການສັ່ງຊື້ເພີ່ມ, ແລະ ປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ສິນ"
"ຄ້າຂາດສາງ."

#. module: candy_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:candy_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Loyalty Programs</strong>: Reward repeat customers with loyalty "
"points and discounts."
msgstr ""
"<strong>ໂຄງການລູກຄ້າປະຈຳ</strong>: ມອບລາງວັນໃຫ້ແກ່ລູກຄ້າປະຈຳດ້ວຍຄະແນນສະສົມ ແລະ ສ່ວນຫຼຸດ."

#. module: candy_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:candy_shop.welcome_article_body
