#. module: candy_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:candy_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Odoo will calculate the price automatically based on the weight entered at "
"checkout.<br/>\n"
"                            <br/>"
msgstr ""
"Odoo ຈະຄິດໄລ່ລາຄາໃຫ້ແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ ໂດຍອີງຕາມນ້ຳໜັກທີ່ປ້ອນເຂົ້າຕອນຄິດເງິນ.<br/>\n"
"                            <br/>"

#. module: candy_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:candy_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Odoo’s <strong>Point of Sale (POS)</strong> system ensures fast and smooth "
"transactions in your candy shop. Whether you sell individual sweets, "
"packaged candies, or bulk pick &amp; mix, Odoo has you covered."
msgstr ""
"ລະບົບ <strong>Point of Sale (POS)</strong> ຂອງ Odoo ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການເຮັດທຸລະກຳໃນຮ້ານຂະໜົມຂ"
"ອງທ່ານວ່ອງໄວ ແລະ ຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ. ບໍ່ວ່າທ່ານຈະຂາຍຂະໜົມແບບແຍກຊິ້ນ, ແບບຫໍ່ເປັນຊຸດ, ຫຼື ແບບເລືອກຕັກປະສົມເອ"
"ງ, Odoo ກໍຕອບໂຈດໄດ້ທັງໝົດ."

#. module: candy_shop
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:candy_shop.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Orders placed online are automatically recorded in <strong>Sales</strong>."
msgstr ""
"ຄຳສັ່ງຊື້ຜ່ານທາງອອນລາຍຈະຖືກບັນທຶກລົງໃນ <strong>ການຂາຍ (Sales)</strong> ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

